## 1. Konsep

Ini modul **smoke test**. Kalau semua di bawah tampil rapi, platform siap diisi konten.

Inline `code` dan fenced block harus ter-highlight:

```svelte
<script>
	let count = $state(0);
</script>

<button onclick={() => count++}>Klik: {count}</button>
```

<Callout type="tip">
Reactivity di Svelte itu seperti <strong>papan tulis ajaib</strong>: ubah satu angka, semua hitungan yang bergantung ikut berubah otomatis.
</Callout>

## 2. Playground

<Playground code={`<script>
	let count = $state(0);
	let double = $derived(count * 2);
</script>

<h3>Hitungan: {count}</h3>
<p>Dua kali lipat: {double}</p>
<button onclick={() => count++}>Tambah</button>`} />

## 3. Perbandingan framework

<FrameworkCompare
	task="State reaktif sederhana"
	svelte={`<script>
	let count = $state(0);
</script>
<button onclick={() => count++}>{count}</button>`}
	react={`function Counter() {
	const [count, setCount] = useState(0);
	return <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>{count}</button>;
}`}
	vue={`<script setup>
import { ref } from 'vue'
const count = ref(0)
</script>
<template>
	<button @click="count++">{{ count }}</button>
</template>`}
	diff={{ react: [2], vue: [3] }}
	note="Svelte meng-compile reactivity, jadi tak perlu setter atau .value."
/>

## 4. Legacy vs modern

<LegacyVsModern rows={[
	{ legacy: 'export let title', modern: 'let { title } = $props()' },
	{ legacy: '$: double = count * 2', modern: 'let double = $derived(count * 2)' },
	{ legacy: 'on:click', modern: 'onclick' }
]} />

## 5. Latihan

<Exercise title="Coba ubah playground">
Ubah playground di atas agar tombol mengurangi, bukan menambah.

{#snippet solution()}

```svelte
<button onclick={() => count--}>Kurang</button>
```

{/snippet}
</Exercise>

<Callout type="pitfall">
Jangan lupa: <code>$state</code> hanya berlaku di file <code>.svelte</code> atau <code>.svelte.js/ts</code>.
</Callout>

